<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Heritage started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Heritage started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of American Heritage Life Investment Corp and Life Re Corp as outperform.</p>
<p>-- American Heritage rose 3/8 to 24-7/8, while Life added 1/8 to 39-1/8.</p>
</text>
